Scenario: Ticket Form Validation for Multiple Organizations
	End users should be able to see all available products in the Product dropdown field for a given organization when submitting a request.

	Given I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk Enduser1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb                 |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                       |
	| Role             | End-user                            |
	| Access           | Organization                        |
	| Email            | zendesk.enduser1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                   |
	| Organization     | Frontend Org Name 1                 |
	| Language         | English                             |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)          |
	| External ID      | Enduser1                            |
	And I assign a user with the email address "zendesk.enduser1@zendesk.com.broken" to an organization with organizationExternalId "FrontendOrg2"
	And I assign an organization with organizationExternalId "FrontendOrg1" with the following tags
	| developer_tools         |
	| mobile_experience       |
	| productivity_tools_sync |
	| liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	And I assign an organization with organizationExternalId "FrontendOrg2" with the following tags
	| management_tools_lcs    |
	| liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| liferay_commerce        |
	When I log into zendesk as "zendesk.enduser1@zendesk.com.broken" with password "zendeskqauser"
	And I go to the Submit a ticket form
	And I click on the "Organization" dropdown
	And I click the option "Frontend Org Name 1"
	And I click on the "Product" dropdown
	Then I should see the following options
	| Developer Tools           |
	| Liferay DXP               |
	| Liferay DXP Cloud         |
	| Liferay Portal            |
	| Mobile Experience         |
	| Productivity Tools (Sync) |
	And the following options should not be visible
	| Liferay Analytics Cloud |
	| Liferay Commerce        |
	| Management Tools (LCS)  |
	When I click the option "-"
	And I click on the "Organization" dropdown
	And I click the option "Frontend Org Name 2"
	And I click on the "Product" dropdown
	Then I should see the following options
	| Liferay Analytics Cloud |
	| Liferay Commerce        |
	| Liferay DXP             |
	| Liferay Portal          |
